WEBVTT

00:00.980 --> 00:02.980
Kannazuki no Miko

00:02.981 --> 00:04.980
Priestesses of the Godless Month

00:09.470 --> 00:11.440
Sensei, what is...

00:20.490 --> 00:23.340
Chikane-chan, why?

00:23.790 --> 00:25.000
Chikane-chan...

00:48.860 --> 00:52.925
haruka ni sotto yurameku urei
kattou no kioku ni ugokasare

00:52.926 --> 00:56.989
Moving the slowly unfolding, distressing
troubles from afar that were in the past

00:56.990 --> 01:00.055
mabuta ni zutto haritsuku
shiroi zekkyou ni kogoeta

01:00.056 --> 01:03.119
Strongly closing the eyelids,
the white screams have frozen

01:03.120 --> 01:05.250
- shizumu tsuki no mayoi
- The confusion of the setting moon

01:05.880 --> 01:07.650
Sonzai wa tashikani Ima koko ni

01:07.651 --> 01:09.419
Surely my existence is here now

01:09.420 --> 01:11.130
- matte iru no wa
- Waiting for me

01:11.133 --> 01:12.465
Namida nado mou nagasanai

01:12.466 --> 01:13.799
There's no more tears to cry

01:13.800 --> 01:15.925
tada dakiaeru shunkan

01:15.926 --> 01:18.050
When the moment comes when
we embrace each other

01:18.510 --> 01:20.660
ienai kikenai mienai maboroshi dake

01:20.661 --> 01:22.810
Unspoken, unheard, unseen, just an illusion

01:23.020 --> 01:25.460
toki no mukou kawa e to nagasarete

01:25.461 --> 01:27.899
Flowing towards the other side of time,

01:27.900 --> 01:30.235
mayoigo ni naru yurusenu negai

01:30.236 --> 01:32.570
becoming like a lost
child, an unforgiven wish

01:32.860 --> 01:35.050
koe dake yubi dake chikazuku ondo dake

01:35.051 --> 01:37.239
Only voice, only fingers,
only the approaching warmth

01:37.240 --> 01:41.535
todokanu omoi ga chigirarete
yokaze o someru

01:41.536 --> 01:45.830
Unspoken thoughts get tainted
by the shredded night wind

01:59.150 --> 02:00.370
I'm...

02:00.950 --> 02:02.180
alive?

02:03.520 --> 02:05.349
How are you feeling?

02:05.350 --> 02:06.520
Kazuki-niisan.

02:06.830 --> 02:08.790
What exactly happened?

02:10.020 --> 02:12.525
Ninth Episode

02:12.526 --> 02:15.030
To the Edge of Hell

02:17.130 --> 02:18.299
I see.

02:18.300 --> 02:19.780
That's what happened.

02:20.240 --> 02:21.780
Himemiya told me.

02:23.340 --> 02:26.360
That she's become an Orochi.

02:27.610 --> 02:30.209
I couldn't do a thing.

02:30.210 --> 02:31.409
Not one.

02:31.410 --> 02:34.300
Why couldn't we revive Ame no Murakumo?

02:34.480 --> 02:37.800
The reason might be that
one priestess or both...

02:38.130 --> 02:41.590
didn't wish for the revival.

02:42.890 --> 02:47.899
From what I've heard, it's natural to
think Himemiya-kun is the problem.

02:47.900 --> 02:49.060
Himemiya?

02:49.340 --> 02:50.599
How?

02:50.600 --> 02:54.999
It's possible her conscious or
her unknowing subconscious...

02:55.000 --> 02:57.539
was holding her back.

02:57.540 --> 02:59.270
Subconscious?

03:00.940 --> 03:02.280
Also, Souma.

03:02.880 --> 03:06.410
Have you noticed the dark
scales on your body?

03:07.650 --> 03:09.200
That's a curse.

03:09.440 --> 03:10.440
Curse?

03:10.500 --> 03:14.339
Though you're an Orochi, you
disobeyed your mission...

03:14.340 --> 03:16.590
fighting to protect the priestesses.

03:16.960 --> 03:19.880
The more you fight using Orochi's power...

03:19.900 --> 03:22.820
the more the curse will consume you.

03:23.000 --> 03:26.620
And eventually, you will
no longer be yourself.

03:27.150 --> 03:29.930
Orochi's evil will consume
your body and soul...

03:30.310 --> 03:33.930
or you'll become a devil
with no self-control.

03:34.640 --> 03:39.940
Either I destroy myself by fighting,
or I destroy the world by not fighting.

03:40.320 --> 03:42.149
One of the two.

03:42.150 --> 03:43.349
Souma...

03:43.350 --> 03:45.230
It's fine, Kazuki.

03:45.620 --> 03:50.840
I don't care about myself if
I can protect Kurusugawa.

03:52.290 --> 03:53.790
But I can't win.

03:54.100 --> 03:58.000
I don't have any means of fighting.

03:58.400 --> 04:00.870
What should I do, Niisan?

04:07.010 --> 04:08.010
Himeko.

04:08.480 --> 04:10.390
Come on over, Himeko.

04:15.180 --> 04:18.360
She's been like that all this time.

04:23.740 --> 04:25.529
What are you doing? Niisan?

04:25.530 --> 04:26.530
Sensei!

04:26.730 --> 04:30.199
You can't be making her do
the revival ritual alone.

04:30.200 --> 04:33.100
To inform the priestess of the reality.

04:33.370 --> 04:35.329
That is my duty.

04:35.330 --> 04:36.829
I know that.

04:36.830 --> 04:38.840
But you don't have to do it now.

04:39.370 --> 04:41.839
She's having the hardest time.

04:41.840 --> 04:45.840
Can't you be a little more considerate?

04:46.180 --> 04:48.979
It's not for you to decide. Move.

04:48.980 --> 04:49.980
Niisan!

04:52.610 --> 04:53.610
Souma!

04:56.290 --> 04:58.589
What must you do?

04:58.590 --> 05:02.199
Cry together with Kurusugawa?

05:02.200 --> 05:04.240
Is that what you should do right now?

05:05.470 --> 05:06.990
Do you really think so?

05:09.200 --> 05:12.670
You should know what you're supposed to do.

05:16.510 --> 05:17.620
Niisan...

05:20.020 --> 05:22.049
With things as they are...

05:22.050 --> 05:25.630
you must revive Ame no Murakumo alone.

05:27.060 --> 05:31.140
A tremendous burden will
be imposed upon you.

05:31.590 --> 05:35.580
But if this isn't done, this world
will be destroyed by the Orochi.

05:41.610 --> 05:42.610
Chikane-chan...

05:42.940 --> 05:45.460
I can't do this alone.

05:46.010 --> 05:49.610
I can't do anything without you.

05:49.950 --> 05:51.200
That's not true.

05:52.050 --> 05:54.910
This can only be done by you.

05:55.880 --> 05:57.400
Only by you.

06:01.420 --> 06:03.630
Are you sure, Souma-san?

06:05.860 --> 06:08.630
It must be tough and painful.

06:08.890 --> 06:13.569
But this is the inescapable
destiny given to you two.

06:13.570 --> 06:18.020
You must decide, fight, and
overcome it on your own.

06:25.310 --> 06:27.860
The shield guarding the priestess is gone.

06:28.280 --> 06:31.019
She's practically a sacrificial lamb.

06:31.020 --> 06:35.780
Until the day of judgment, I'll
torture her as much as I can.

06:37.610 --> 06:40.929
Hey, is that attitude allowed?

06:40.930 --> 06:45.769
She acts like she's the strongest,
and she's the newcomer.

06:45.770 --> 06:48.239
You're in a bad mood, meow.

06:48.240 --> 06:49.839
Why, meow?

06:49.840 --> 06:50.590
No reason.

06:50.850 --> 06:53.230
Because she's losing in many ways.

06:54.670 --> 06:57.410
Ah, you're right, meow.

06:57.880 --> 07:00.189
Who's losing? I'll kill you.

07:00.190 --> 07:02.550
Hey, Lunar Boob Girl.

07:04.650 --> 07:11.170
Aneki told me a lot about
the reason you joined us.

07:14.450 --> 07:16.040
What's this?

07:16.300 --> 07:20.869
Acting big 'cause of your status,
but you're the biggest pervert.

07:20.870 --> 07:22.660
You disgust me.

07:23.640 --> 07:25.669
I'll make this clear.

07:25.670 --> 07:29.979
Hime-chan's mine, so suck your
thumb in the corner and watch.

07:29.980 --> 07:31.550
Got it, perv...

07:53.800 --> 07:55.530
Welcome back...

07:59.710 --> 08:00.710
Himeko.

08:00.980 --> 08:02.709
Chikane-chan...

08:02.710 --> 08:03.780
Why?

08:04.320 --> 08:05.610
Chikane-chan!

08:08.280 --> 08:09.280
Himeko.

08:09.350 --> 08:10.540
Chikane-chan!

08:24.700 --> 08:27.480
Where did you go, Chikane-chan?

08:32.470 --> 08:33.900
D-Damn you.

08:34.080 --> 08:36.009
I won't kill you.

08:36.010 --> 08:39.570
But from here on, it's her and my banquet.

08:40.650 --> 08:43.010
I don't want anyone to bother us.

08:43.220 --> 08:44.910
Don't mess around.

08:45.170 --> 08:46.420
Hime-chan's my...

08:48.160 --> 08:50.420
Become silent stone.

08:57.100 --> 09:01.739
Chikane-chan, you'd never
leave me alone, right?

09:01.740 --> 09:03.600
I'm sure she'll be waiting there.

09:04.270 --> 09:06.509
Right, Chikane-chan?

09:06.510 --> 09:08.360
Don't bother you?

09:09.410 --> 09:10.609
Get real!

09:10.610 --> 09:13.109
I'll turn you into stone!

09:13.110 --> 09:14.859
I'm pissed.

09:14.860 --> 09:17.350
I hate you!

09:20.060 --> 09:21.819
Don't worry.

09:21.820 --> 09:25.050
I'll take on all your roles.

09:29.380 --> 09:30.860
They all hit.

09:31.570 --> 09:32.790
Hooray!

09:39.870 --> 09:43.890
That's not fair!

09:50.320 --> 09:51.350
Chikane-chan.

09:51.920 --> 09:53.860
She'll be there.

09:54.670 --> 09:56.120
I'm sure she will.

09:58.990 --> 10:01.950
Why, Kurusugawa-san.

10:02.220 --> 10:04.299
Coming to school now?

10:04.300 --> 10:07.959
What time do you think it is?

10:07.960 --> 10:11.909
By the way, why isn't Miya-sama here today?

10:11.910 --> 10:14.209
She's not at school?

10:14.210 --> 10:16.639
Don't you know something?

10:16.640 --> 10:18.710
Could you tell us?

10:20.050 --> 10:21.550
That can't be.

10:22.120 --> 10:23.120
What's that?

10:23.650 --> 10:26.219
Chikane-chan will come.

10:26.220 --> 10:30.690
I know Chikane-chan will wait for me here.

10:31.020 --> 10:34.499
What a surprise. You
call her "Chikane-chan."

10:34.500 --> 10:37.190
You dare call our Miya-sama "Chikane-chan."

10:37.380 --> 10:39.529
Just because she's nice...

10:39.530 --> 10:43.200
Besides, it's off-limits here.
She wouldn't be here.

10:43.510 --> 10:46.639
Chikane-chan, are you really gone?

10:46.640 --> 10:47.710
Chikane-chan.

10:56.920 --> 10:59.380
M-Mako-chan.

11:12.460 --> 11:13.460
Um...

11:13.670 --> 11:15.269
Hey, Mako-chan.

11:15.270 --> 11:16.400
Hey, you.

11:16.770 --> 11:21.280
We're having an important
discussion with Kurusugawa-san.

11:21.530 --> 11:22.779
Hold on.

11:22.780 --> 11:24.609
You seem to misunderstand...

11:24.610 --> 11:26.040
Move it.

11:26.330 --> 11:28.540
Look, you...

11:29.050 --> 11:30.050
Move!

11:34.650 --> 11:36.590
I'll remember this!

12:05.920 --> 12:07.889
How could this be?

12:07.890 --> 12:11.080
Is this the power of the Lunar Priestess?

12:11.430 --> 12:16.089
Everything in this world belongs
to Orochi... No, to Tsubasa-sama.

12:16.090 --> 12:19.090
No matter what, I will not
let anyone interfere!

12:23.970 --> 12:25.590
Yokusemi no Mizuchi!

12:44.630 --> 12:46.560
What a stupid attack.

13:06.480 --> 13:09.100
Impossible! H-How could...

13:17.760 --> 13:22.459
Do you understand now that
your darkness and despair...

13:22.460 --> 13:26.900
are just shadows that disappear
under the moon's light?

13:28.470 --> 13:30.470
Tsubasa-sama...

13:31.470 --> 13:33.660
Farewell, Sister.

13:51.530 --> 13:52.750
Mako-chan?

13:54.200 --> 13:56.729
Is your leg better now?

13:56.730 --> 13:59.669
Oh, I'm out of the hospital.

13:59.670 --> 14:02.150
I'm actually told that it's too early...

14:02.740 --> 14:05.810
but my body just can't stay still.

14:07.230 --> 14:10.909
So I'll help our team manager
during rehabilitation.

14:10.910 --> 14:12.910
Well, I'll take my time.

14:14.180 --> 14:15.250
Why?

14:16.250 --> 14:18.319
When I'm to blame.

14:18.320 --> 14:20.390
When it's my fault.

14:20.920 --> 14:23.420
Why did you help me?

14:24.330 --> 14:29.629
I knew I had to apologize. I
wanted to visit you many times.

14:29.630 --> 14:33.529
But I was too scared to meet you.
I didn't have the courage.

14:33.530 --> 14:35.839
Yet you...

14:35.840 --> 14:38.060
I'm the same way, too.

14:40.210 --> 14:46.400
Back then, I was in pain and so
frustrated that I was stressed out.

14:47.350 --> 14:50.950
That's why I took my feelings out on you.

14:53.520 --> 14:56.450
It was an accident, you know.

14:56.960 --> 15:00.000
I knew you weren't to blame.

15:00.460 --> 15:04.420
I knew it wasn't your fault.

15:06.960 --> 15:11.970
I knew I had to apologize,
but I just couldn't.

15:12.910 --> 15:18.040
If I hadn't seen you there, I don't
think I'd be able to talk like this.

15:18.750 --> 15:21.349
I'm not as gutsy as I thought.

15:21.350 --> 15:23.719
But, Mako-chan... But...

15:23.720 --> 15:25.449
No buts.

15:25.450 --> 15:27.959
This talk ends here, okay?

15:27.960 --> 15:28.950
Mako-chan.

15:28.951 --> 15:30.990
Enough of me. What about you?

15:31.690 --> 15:34.130
Things are rough, right?

15:34.360 --> 15:36.490
It's written on your face.

15:38.000 --> 15:42.670
Leaving the details aside,
I can kind of tell.

15:43.760 --> 15:45.970
Since you're honest.

15:53.650 --> 15:55.519
Hey, Himeko.

15:55.520 --> 16:00.230
If things get so hard and tough
that you can't take another step...

16:01.160 --> 16:03.640
come to me.

16:04.330 --> 16:06.230
I'll do anything with you.

16:06.590 --> 16:07.940
Anything for you.

16:08.530 --> 16:10.999
But you can't be slacking off now, right?

16:11.000 --> 16:13.490
You and I can't be.

16:17.540 --> 16:19.270
Mako-chan...

16:21.780 --> 16:23.500
Don't cry.

16:24.210 --> 16:26.060
Do your best, Himeko.

16:26.880 --> 16:28.949
Don't lose.

16:28.950 --> 16:30.350
Do your best.

16:31.220 --> 16:32.620
Do your best.

16:48.070 --> 16:50.360
A letter? For me?

16:51.470 --> 16:52.900
Otoha-san.

17:51.670 --> 17:54.669
Dear Kurusugawa-sama,

17:54.670 --> 17:58.280
I hope that everyone is doing well there.

17:58.710 --> 18:01.429
As for Ojousama's uncle's condition...

18:01.430 --> 18:06.009
it seems he is past the critical
stage and starting to recover.

18:06.010 --> 18:09.749
Since the master's business
is also running smoothly...

18:09.750 --> 18:13.090
it appears I will be able to
return sometime early next week.

18:14.580 --> 18:17.170
I wonder how Ojousama is doing.

18:19.530 --> 18:22.029
She is a strong person.

18:22.030 --> 18:26.030
She is a person who pursues
her beliefs unyieldingly.

18:27.040 --> 18:30.609
It may not seem that she
needs others' help...

18:30.610 --> 18:31.610
But...

18:35.000 --> 18:36.779
Even if that's true...

18:36.780 --> 18:40.680
I think there has to be
someone watching over her.

18:41.300 --> 18:44.149
A person by her side...

18:44.150 --> 18:48.520
who senses what she is
feeling, thinking, and needing.

18:50.660 --> 18:54.510
Ojousama has always been waiting for you.

18:54.900 --> 18:56.790
Waiting for me?

19:36.270 --> 19:37.599
Interesting.

19:37.600 --> 19:39.400
Interesting, Lunar Priestess.

19:40.130 --> 19:43.249
An Orochi has a deep-seated grudge.

19:43.250 --> 19:46.679
A form of deep despair and dark hatred.

19:46.680 --> 19:51.620
A sign of a strong resolve to
destroy all, including man's world.

19:52.120 --> 19:58.130
You're the Orochi of Orochi who
embodies all eight in one form.

19:59.760 --> 20:01.899
You're like me.

20:01.900 --> 20:05.130
So alike that you're like a mirror image.

20:05.470 --> 20:07.599
Don't be silly.

20:07.600 --> 20:09.530
The Solar Priestess?

20:10.530 --> 20:15.270
The hell you embody is better
suited for Souma right now.

20:16.210 --> 20:19.479
After the fight, I'd like to find out...

20:19.480 --> 20:27.389
whether he'll seek a higher rank
or drop to the bottom of hell.

20:27.390 --> 20:28.390
What are you planning?

20:28.690 --> 20:31.459
Farewell, Lunar Priestess.

20:31.460 --> 20:33.120
Orochi's priestess.

20:34.160 --> 20:35.560
Souma.

20:55.150 --> 20:56.380
What's this?

20:57.590 --> 20:59.240
U-Um...

21:02.120 --> 21:04.329
What I need to do...

21:04.330 --> 21:05.330
My...

21:09.330 --> 21:10.620
Chikane-chan.

21:11.370 --> 21:14.500
This can only be done by you.

21:15.000 --> 21:17.399
Do your best, Himeko. Don't lose.

21:17.400 --> 21:18.669
Do your best.

21:18.670 --> 21:22.080
Ojousama has always been waiting for you.

21:23.080 --> 21:24.380
Himeko.

21:24.680 --> 21:25.779
I...

21:25.780 --> 21:26.850
I...

21:27.920 --> 21:30.149
want to see Chikane-chan.

21:30.150 --> 21:33.149
I want to talk to Chikane-chan.

21:33.150 --> 21:36.119
I want to know Chikane-chan's feelings.

21:36.120 --> 21:37.350
Chikane-chan!

21:43.230 --> 21:45.030
Tsubasa-niisan...

22:03.080 --> 22:05.050
I'll do it.

22:07.820 --> 22:09.550
Please let me.

22:10.140 --> 22:11.820
- Itsuka mita yume
- A dream that was once saw

22:11.823 --> 22:13.830
- Todokanai tsubuyaki dake
- Just a murmur that does not get through

22:13.833 --> 22:15.635
Yoru no hikari ni tsutsumarete samayoi yuku

22:15.636 --> 22:17.439
Wandering while wrapped up in night's light

22:17.440 --> 22:21.020
- Yagate mihiraku sono hitomi Unmei nara - If it
is fate, those eyes will be opened before long

22:21.023 --> 22:22.545
Semete Sou ima dake

22:22.546 --> 22:24.069
At least... yes, only now

22:24.070 --> 22:26.430
- Kanawanai to utsumuku - Looking
downward as the wish does not come true

22:26.433 --> 22:28.430
- Yokaze ni tada unadare
- Merely hanging my head in the night wind

22:28.433 --> 22:32.120
- Namida Tsukikage Te no hira ni afurete yuku - Tears
and moonlight continue to overflow from my palm

22:32.123 --> 22:33.690
- Nani ga hoshii no
- What do you want?

22:33.693 --> 22:35.910
Kuchibiru wa yami ni furuete ita

22:35.911 --> 22:38.129
My lips shivered in the darkness

22:38.130 --> 22:40.470
Deatta ano toki ni mune tsuita egao

22:40.471 --> 22:42.809
The smiling face that pierced
my chest when we came across

22:42.810 --> 22:45.750
Mamoritakute Zutto kuzuresou na yakusoku o

22:45.751 --> 22:48.689
I want to protect it, the promise
that always looks about to collapse

22:48.690 --> 22:50.725
Itami tsubusu hodo ni dakishimeteta

22:50.726 --> 22:52.760
I embraced it while crushing the pain

22:53.600 --> 22:55.015
Soba ni ireru dake de

22:55.016 --> 22:56.429
Just by being by my side

22:56.430 --> 22:58.240
Onaji jikan ni irareru dake de

22:58.241 --> 23:00.049
Just by remaining in the same time as me

23:00.050 --> 23:03.520
Tooi kioku Yomigaeru kanashimi
mo atatamete yukeru no ni

23:03.521 --> 23:06.989
The distant memory and
revived sadness can warmed

23:06.990 --> 23:08.970
Mawaritsuzukete iru omoi ni

23:08.971 --> 23:10.949
In the feelings that continue to circulate

23:10.950 --> 23:12.765
Yasuragi michita owari wa kuru no

23:12.766 --> 23:14.579
Will a peaceful ending come?

23:14.580 --> 23:16.400
Kurikaeshita toikake wa ten ni mai

23:16.401 --> 23:18.219
The repeated question dance in heavens

23:18.220 --> 23:23.745
Ake no sora no Hikari ni kawaru

23:23.746 --> 23:29.270
And turns into the light of the morning sky

23:40.060 --> 23:41.449
Next Time

23:41.450 --> 23:44.770
Although the arms that
embrace me are still kind...

23:46.090 --> 23:50.150
the smile slashes me like a blade.

23:50.860 --> 23:56.280
Her truth slips from my hands
like the moon's shadow.

23:57.230 --> 23:59.039
But still, I must...

23:59.040 --> 24:00.469
Invitation of Love and Death

24:00.470 --> 24:03.469
Next time on Kannazuki
no Miko, episode 10...

24:03.470 --> 24:05.539
Invitation of Love and Death.

24:05.540 --> 24:09.010
Chikane-chan, what am I supposed to do?
